marid|Saudipedia — Marid Archaeological Castle location|https://saudipedia.com/en/where-is-marid-archaeological-castle-located|Marid Castle is in Dumat al-Jandal in Al-Jawf Province.
fountain|Saudipedia — King Fahd's Fountain|https://saudipedia.com/en/king-fahd%22s-fountain|King Fahd's Fountain stands on Jeddah's Red Sea coast. Do not assert current world-record status.
kiswa|Saudipedia — Al-Kaaba's Kiswa|https://saudipedia.com/en/al-kaaba%22s-kiswa|Kiswa is Kaaba's cloth covering; King Abdulaziz ordered a dedicated manufacturing factory in Makkah. Avoid changing replacement dates unless verified in dated official records.
