faisal|Saudipedia — King Faisal bin Abdulaziz|https://saudipedia.com/en/faisal-bin-abdulaziz-al-saud|King Faisal was third king of Saudi Arabia; imposed oil export embargo against US and other countries in October 1973.
buraydah|Saudipedia — Buraydah City|https://saudipedia.com/en/buraydah-city|Buraydah's date festival is a prominent date market. Avoid current ranking and production figures.
